(7414217, 1168960, 159723, '<td valign="top">Love it! Like it even better now on second look. Bumping up to a 9.  The colors are just beautiful and cudos for capturing the reflection in the water. Makes the image extra interesting. I''m n my view you have just enough forground to balance the gorgeous montains and tree line. Good luck in the challenge :)</td>', 'Love it! Like it even better now on second look. Bumping up to a 9.  The colors are just beautiful and cudos for capturing the reflection in the water. Makes the image extra interesting. I''m n my view you have just enough forground to balance the gorgeous montains and tree line. Good luck in the challenge :)', '2015-11-04 13:06:10.000000', NULL, 1),
