(7414389, 1168892, 159723, '<td valign="top">I like it! The "surfer" makes it a bit different the sunset/sunrise images I usually see. I wonder if the rocks could benefit from being even darker, because the guy is almost a silhouette (at least on my screen), or vice versa. Or maybe I''m completely wrong :) Still, its a nice image. I gave it an 8. Good luck in the challenge! :)</td>', 'I like it! The "surfer" makes it a bit different the sunset/sunrise images I usually see. I wonder if the rocks could benefit from being even darker, because the guy is almost a silhouette (at least on my screen), or vice versa. Or maybe I''m completely wrong :) Still, its a nice image. I gave it an 8. Good luck in the challenge! :)', '2015-11-05 04:33:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(7414390, 1168764, 159723, '<td valign="top">Super nice and smooth water. Just enough detail in the forground. For me the color balance is great. Very harmonious! The vignetting/burning in the left corners is perhaps a tiny tiny bit too dark, but that is only a minor issue for me. The rest is great! Good luck in the challenge :)</td>', 'Super nice and smooth water. Just enough detail in the forground. For me the color balance is great. Very harmonious! The vignetting/burning in the left corners is perhaps a tiny tiny bit too dark, but that is only a minor issue for me. The rest is great! Good luck in the challenge :)', '2015-11-05 04:38:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(7414403, 1169135, 159723, '<td valign="top">Wonderful! Perfect silhouette of the tree line! Details in the moon looks great! Best of luck in the challenge :)</td>', 'Wonderful! Perfect silhouette of the tree line! Details in the moon looks great! Best of luck in the challenge :)', '2015-11-05 09:19:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(7414405, 1168982, 159723, '<td valign="top">They look a bit evil! Are they? The big one even has some flames in his right eye ;p But seriously, nice capture! Best of luck in the challenge :)</td>', 'They look a bit evil! Are they? The big one even has some flames in his right eye ;p But seriously, nice capture! Best of luck in the challenge :)', '2015-11-05 09:23:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(7414406, 1168445, 159723, '<td valign="top">I can''t really put my finger on what (in my eyes) does not look quite right in this image. It''s a 7 from me. Maybe it is the soft calm feel of the horizon against the more saturated, clear houses? I''m not sure. Still, I like the angle and the city works well as a leading line towards the horizon. Best of luck in the challenge.</td>', 'I can''t really put my finger on what (in my eyes) does not look quite right in this image. It''s a 7 from me. Maybe it is the soft calm feel of the horizon against the more saturated, clear houses? I''m not sure. Still, I like the angle and the city works well as a leading line towards the horizon. Best of luck in the challenge.', '2015-11-05 09:28:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(7414435, 1168856, 73942, '<td valign="top">I think a tighter crop may have helped this appeal to more people.</td>', 'I think a tighter crop may have helped this appeal to more people.', '2015-11-05 13:00:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(7414436, 1168849, 73942, '<td valign="top">great title</td>', 'great title', '2015-11-05 13:01:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(7414444, 1169108, 159723, '<td valign="top">Great capture! Lovely colors and nice soft feeling in the water and the sky. I think I would prefer a little less rocks in the photo and more water, but not sure how I would had solved this if this was my image. Perhaps a different crop or maybe taking the picture from a different angle? Then again I could be completely wrong on the rock/sea ratio :) (BTW, do you need to clean your lens or sensor? I rubbed my screen for ages before I realized it was the image! Haha...) Good luck in the challenge :)</td>', 'Great capture! Lovely colors and nice soft feeling in the water and the sky. I think I would prefer a little less rocks in the photo and more water, but not sure how I would had solved this if this was my image. Perhaps a different crop or maybe taking the picture from a different angle? Then again I could be completely wrong on the rock/sea ratio :) (BTW, do you need to clean your lens or sensor? I rubbed my screen for ages before I realized it was the image! Haha...) Good luck in the challenge :)', '2015-11-05 13:39:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(7414445, 1168847, 159723, '<td valign="top">Love it! Just enough background blur and great b&amp;w. I like it even better now on second look. Bumping you up! Best of luck in the challenge :)</td>', 'Love it! Just enough background blur and great b&w. I like it even better now on second look. Bumping you up! Best of luck in the challenge :)', '2015-11-05 13:39:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(7414446, 1169162, 159723, '<td valign="top">Not sure why but the first thing I thought of when I saw this was Twin Peaks :) I like it! In my view it is not quite as strong as some of the other landscapes entered in this challenge, but definitely a nice image. Lovely warm autumn colors and I think you have captured the details in the birch well. The track makes a good line for my eyes to follow. I get the feeling it continues for miles upon miles. Best of luck in the challenge :)</td>', 'Not sure why but the first thing I thought of when I saw this was Twin Peaks :) I like it! In my view it is not quite as strong as some of the other landscapes entered in this challenge, but definitely a nice image. Lovely warm autumn colors and I think you have captured the details in the birch well. The track makes a good line for my eyes to follow. I get the feeling it continues for miles upon miles. Best of luck in the challenge :)', '2015-11-05 13:40:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(7414447, 1169088, 159723, '<td valign="top">Great capture and lovely minimal processing. Love that the pink sky is reflected in the shore/sand (not sure what to call it). For once the title was very helpful for me. Definitely made me focus on the layer component of the image. The person adds a element. The image would not been the same without him/her. Awesome job! Best of luck in the challenge :)</td>', 'Great capture and lovely minimal processing. Love that the pink sky is reflected in the shore/sand (not sure what to call it). For once the title was very helpful for me. Definitely made me focus on the layer component of the image. The person adds a element. The image would not been the same without him/her. Awesome job! Best of luck in the challenge :)', '2015-11-05 13:42:07.000000', NULL, 1),
