(7414622, 1169154, 159723, '<td valign="top">I think it is a clever idea to use the branches as a kind of frame, but in this particular images I feel like they are a bit to dominating. The mountains and the forest in the background are beautiful and you have captured them really well. The reflection is also very nice. Good luck in the challenge :)</td>', 'I think it is a clever idea to use the branches as a kind of frame, but in this particular images I feel like they are a bit to dominating. The mountains and the forest in the background are beautiful and you have captured them really well. The reflection is also very nice. Good luck in the challenge :)', '2015-11-06 14:23:02.000000', NULL, 1),
