(7414868, 1169088, 136989, '<td valign="top">Thank you for a moment of calm and serenity in the middle of a hectic week.  A brief stroll along the beach (even if it was in my imagination) was a much needed break. While I do wish the horizon was a bit more in contrast with the ocean I love the balance of blue and pink.  My favorite in this challenge.<br/><a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=1082013" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/135000-139999/136989/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_1082013.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/135000-139999/136989/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_1082013.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/135000-139999/136989/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_1082013.jpg"/></a></td>', 'Thank you for a moment of calm and serenity in the middle of a hectic week.  A brief stroll along the beach (even if it was in my imagination) was a much needed break. While I do wish the horizon was a bit more in contrast with the ocean I love the balance of blue and pink.  My favorite in this challenge.', '2015-11-07 22:26:45.000000', NULL, 1),
